BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (Action: Record the reviewer, supporting evidence version, approved scope, and release timestamp.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (Detail: Recheck current evidence immediately before execution so stale reviews cannot authorize new facts.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (Step: 4) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (Title: Reconcile execution and recover exceptions) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (Action: Confirm delivery or completion, then reconcile the action against the durable event ledger.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (Detail: Route uncertain outcomes to manual verification before retrying any externally visible action.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 617.65 Tm (Model a transaction as dependencies, not a universal closing-date template. Begin with representative identity,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 602.42 Tm (appointment evidence, scope of authority, property ownership, engagement terms, and the jurisdiction's sale procedure.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 587.20 Tm (California illustrates why branching matters: Probate Code section 10501 distinguishes powers available under full) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 571.97 Tm (versus limited authority, while sections 10580 through 10592 address notice of proposed action procedures when) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 556.75 Tm (applicable. Sales subject to court confirmation follow a different path; section 10308 addresses qualifying increased) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (offers at confirmation. Do not generalize that path to every state or every California estate. Have estate counsel or the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm (responsible qualified professional identify the applicable route and record the supporting instrument. Only then) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm (generate draft tasks for notices, valuation evidence, marketing, hearings, objections, and closing conditions. Never) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.85 Tm (derive a controlling deadline solely from an LLM reading a docket caption. Use the actual order, applicable rule,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.62 Tm (service details, and reviewed calendar calculation. A new objection, amended order, or authority change invalidates) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 465.40 Tm (dependent tasks and triggers re-review. This design prevents a polished automated checklist from advancing a sale that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.17 Tm (the representative cannot presently authorize.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 434.95 Tm (Define consequential outputs narrowly and explicitly: legal-authority conclusions, pricing recommendations, listing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.72 Tm (publication, offer submission, vendor spending, notices, and settlement instructions require the designated person's) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 404.50 Tm (review. AI can assemble comparable property evidence, but the licensed professional selects adjustments and approves) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 389.27 Tm (pricing. A concierge worker can prepare a cleanout scope, but the authorized representative approves disposal and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 374.05 Tm (spending before anything leaves the property. Store review identity, timestamp, evidence version, and approved action) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 358.82 Tm (scope. Approval expires when material inputs change; it does not attach forever to the estate record. Use two-person) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.60 Tm (verification for changed payment instructions, with an independently sourced callback number rather than contact) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 328.37 Tm (details inside the change request. California Business and Professions Code section 10130 anchors the licensing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 313.15 Tm (boundary for brokerage activity; contractor titles do not expand permitted work. Route questions about fiduciary duties,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 297.92 Tm (conflicts, or contested authority to estate counsel. For acquisitions, disclose the operator's buyer-side interest and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 282.70 Tm (separate it from brokerage representation under the applicable duties. Never let an automated qualification score decide) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 267.47 Tm (which family member controls the engagement or whether an estate should accept an affiliated buyer's offer.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 252.25 Tm (The required gis_landlocked_parcel_easement_assemblage play belongs inside this evidence system, not outside it.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 237.02 Tm (Overlay county parcel geometry with roads and candidate access corridors, then retrieve deeds, easement instruments,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 221.80 Tm (plats, and relevant title exceptions. Geometry screens opportunities; it cannot establish legal access, extinguishment,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 206.57 Tm (scope, maintenance obligations, or the right to transfer an easement. Illustratively, screen 100 parcels at $0.04 each for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 191.35 Tm ($4 of variable compute, review ten candidates for twenty minutes each at $45 per hour for $150, and purchase three) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 176.12 Tm (record packets at $60 for $180. Initial screening costs $334 before title counsel, survey work, travel, or any option) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 160.90 Tm (payment. If one candidate supports a voluntary strip option, a $2,000 option payment plus $3,000 of scoped diligence) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 145.67 Tm (adds $5,000 of separate capital exposure; neither amount is brokerage revenue. Obtain title and survey review before) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 130.45 Tm (negotiating recorded access terms, and use a documented diligence contingency with a realistic expiry. Do not obstruct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 115.22 Tm (existing access or manufacture pressure against neighbors. If rights or economics fail, exercise diligence contingencies) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 100.00 Tm (and offer survey-backed voluntary access services instead. Recognize any separate service economics outside the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 84.77 Tm (canonical brokerage scorecard.) Tj ET
